OL,3,GNEWSA'He saved my baby, now I'm serving
OL,4,Ahim tea and toast'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Birmingham restaurant owner has
OL,7,Fdescribed the moment he realised a
OL,8,Fcustomer sitting at one of his tables
OL,9,Fwas the doctor who helped save his
OL,10,Fdaughter's life.
OL,12,FKray Treadwell and his partner Sacha
OL,13,FTownsend were working at their
OL,14,Frestaurant, 670 Grams, when they
OL,15,Fnoticed a familiar face among a table
OL,16,Fof three diners.
OL,18,FThey could not quite place the man.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
